Routing this as research, round-sized, because picking an OCR engine for signed contracts is costly to get wrong. I need one thing before I write a brief: which three candidates are on the table? I also can't read or write files in this session, so nothing is saved yet.

My view, which you can overrule: don't settle this by argument. Run all three on the same set of your own scanned Arabic contracts, including poor scans and any with tables or stamps, and compare them on character error rate and on whether the cited page is right. The standing brief says the product ships on prem, so any candidate that only runs as a cloud API is out before the test starts. The team decides which one ships.

